Wappalyzer is an external dependency fetched from its upstream repository
at container startup or during explicit setup. Its implementation,
fingerprints and dependencies belong in the runtime cache outside the
application build context, container image and release artifacts.
The tested upstream is https://github.com/tomnomnom/wappalyzer at commit
30450a0841b28b5e89091110774d15867dd265c3. That upstream declares GPL-3.0;
this integration does not relicense it or grant redistribution rights to it.
The installer preserves the upstream license and notices in its checkout.
